{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415771","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415771","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041577101:1":{"text":"발렌, 밀수 루트를 조사해야 하는 장기 임무가 하나 있소.","source_cn":"维伦，这里有一个调查走私线路的长期任务。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A29C50588E25E85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041577102:1":{"text":"은밀히 움직여야 할 뿐만 아니라, 뛰어난 임기응변 능력도 필요하오. 그대가 제일 적합하다고 생각하네만.","source_cn":"不仅需要隐匿行踪，还需要极强的随机应变能力。我觉得你非...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B44E84336991700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041577103:1":{"text":"콜록! 아아, 세상에! 오래된 고질병이 또 도졌네요...","source_cn":"咳咳！哎呀，糟糕。我的旧伤突然复发了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2257B1853AFFADED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041577104:1":{"text":"아무래도 보름은 침대에 누워서 푹 쉬어야 할 것 같은데요!","source_cn":"首领大人，恐怕我最近十天半个月都只能卧床静养了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CF8A13362BB22C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041577105:0":{"text":"오? 이렇게까지 준비된 답변이라니, 오히려 뭐라고 해야 할지 모르겠구려.","source_cn":"哦？说辞准备得如此充分，倒叫我不知该说什么好了。<ke...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3747FBCC6860439","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041577106:1":{"text":"그대에게... 언제든 재발할 수 있는 고질병이 있다는 말은 금시초문이오.","source_cn":"只是……我怎么没听说过你有什么能随时发作的旧伤？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D0B229BB06A422C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041577107:1":{"text":"PTSD! 옛 임무에서 남은 PTSD가 있어서요! 이건 불가항력이죠!","source_cn":"心理创伤！是过往任务留下的心理创伤！这可是不可抗力因素...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA81F4138BDFACFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041577108:1":{"text":"그런 거였구려. 참으로 안타깝게 됐소...","source_cn":"原来如此。在下深表同情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x525FDDC61B7D1221","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041577109:1":{"text":"그렇게 힘든 상황이라면, 다음 주에 있을 옛 기사단 모임과 러스트버켓 주점에 새로 들어온 맥주도... 즐기기 힘들겠구려?","source_cn":"既然你身负重伤，那下周骑士团老兵们的聚会，以及锈桶酒馆...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDA9817159E56631","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041577110:1":{"text":"“요양”에 영향을 주지 않도록 보름 동안은 그대에게 술을 팔지 말라고 포리에게 말해 두겠소.","source_cn":"我会替你向佛里老板打声招呼，让他这半个月都不要卖酒给你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45BC0CCC71C921C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041577111:1":{"text":"잠깐만요! 다시 생각해 보니 이런 PTSD는... 고강도 임무를 통해 극복할 수 있을 것 같거든요!","source_cn":"等等！我觉得……这种心理创伤也是可以通过高强度的任务来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E4EBE64FE1DCF14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041577112:1":{"text":"은둔자의 모두가 힘들게 일하고 있는데, 저 혼자서 요양하고 있을 수는 없죠!","source_cn":"隐士的大家都在辛苦努力地工作，我维伦怎么能因为一点点小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x392AC1E8A1D02CFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041577113:1":{"text":"후후... 그대의 그 숨김없는 교활함이, 억지로 꾸며낸 충성심보다 훨씬 더 재미있는 것 같소.","source_cn":"呵呵……你这种毫不掩饰的滑头，有时确实比那些刻意的忠诚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18CAA504DD372C89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041577114:1":{"text":"가보시게. 덧붙여 말하자면, 그 맥주는 확실히 괜찮더구려. 임무를 완수한 뒤에는 주점에서 마음껏 “요양”해도 좋소.","source_cn":"去吧。顺便一提，那批麦酒的品质确实不错，完成任务后，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B03F285D40FCF0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:埃德加":{"text":"에린도르","source":"埃德加","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}